  // Complete flattened historical record of the package-universe "nothing_fits" discovery-
  // taxonomy vocabulary clustering: raw suggested-category-term string -> pass-1 cluster ->
  // final (post-pass-3) category. Consolidates pass 1's foldedVariants (raw terms per pass-1
  // cluster), pass 2's cluster-to-umbrella folding, and pass 3's kept-15 re-evaluation and
  // merges into one canonical reference.
  //
  // Sections:
  //   finalCategories        - the 93 pass-3 discovery-taxonomy categories, each with every
  //                             raw suggested_terms string that was ever folded into it
  //                             (rawTermsFolded), across all three passes.
  //   existingVocabMappings   - raw terms that turned out to be synonyms of an ALREADY-
  //                             EXISTING closed-vocabulary value in taxonomy.jsonc (e.g.
  //                             "database-cli" -> existing "database-client") rather than a
  //                             new taxonomy category. Not counted among the 93/98 category
  //                             totals.
  //   rejectedTooRare         - pass-1 clusters below the 3-tool support bar (support 1-2),
  //                             never promoted to a category or an existing-vocab mapping.
  //   discardedNoise          - raw suggested_terms entries that were not real category
  //                             candidates at all (reasoning-paragraph noise, "I don't know"
  //                             markers), discarded before normalization/dedup -- these are
  //                             NOT part of the 8,076-distinct-normalized-term pool that the
  //                             other three sections partition.
  //   reconciliation          - term-count accounting tying the above four sections back to
  //                             pass 1's original 8,076 distinct normalized terms.
  //
